WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:03.430
Yes, this is Hirono.

00:04.140 --> 00:07.230
Hello? Is this Miyako?

00:07.230 --> 00:08.400
Bingo.

00:09.150 --> 00:10.320
So I didn't disappear.

00:11.280 --> 00:14.740
I haven't disappeared yet.

00:15.280 --> 00:16.280
Miyako...

00:17.620 --> 00:20.450
Fly high, make it

00:20.450 --> 00:23.750
Get to the new world that I seek

00:23.960 --> 00:30.340
Someday with my little wings

00:30.340 --> 00:36.510
Don't look back to the sorrow I left behind

00:36.720 --> 00:42.720
Here's my real intention I hide

00:43.270 --> 00:49.480
I wish you were here, and so just right by my side

00:49.690 --> 00:55.780
Need to be strong enough to swallow my pride

00:56.070 --> 01:01.740
I have been looking for my own style

01:01.740 --> 01:09.250
Don't give it up, here comes the life

01:12.170 --> 01:14.920
Be alive, take it

01:14.920 --> 01:18.180
Promise to find, yes I will

01:18.430 --> 01:24.640
Shining wings filled with wishes

01:24.930 --> 01:27.690
Fly high, make it

01:27.690 --> 01:31.190
Get to the new world that I seek

01:31.230 --> 01:37.650
Someday, so I believe

01:54.340 --> 01:57.380
Chihiro, this is you.

01:57.840 --> 01:59.220
Take your time.

01:59.220 --> 02:01.970
If you read this, you'll be able to find your lost self.

02:03.220 --> 02:05.100
Is it okay to leave her alone?

02:05.470 --> 02:07.480
The rest is her own problem.

02:07.480 --> 02:08.520
No way...

02:09.190 --> 02:11.770
I told you not to get too involved with Chihiro.

02:12.940 --> 02:16.480
I should've also told you to prepare yourself if you wanted to stay by her side.

02:17.320 --> 02:19.740
Chihiro has lost four years of memories.

02:20.570 --> 02:26.240
And even those were just faint images that maintained her original memories.

02:27.200 --> 02:29.500
If she spends time reading the diary again and again,

02:29.500 --> 02:31.710
she should be able to return to something like her original state.

02:33.540 --> 02:34.540
No way...

02:34.840 --> 02:37.210
It's something that has happened many times before.

02:37.210 --> 02:38.720
It will happen again in the future.

02:39.130 --> 02:45.140
And, the pain will become greater when her memories disappear over time.

02:45.140 --> 02:48.520
In that case, it's even more important that someone stays by her side.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.770
You don't get it.

02:50.980 --> 02:52.810
I wasn't talking about Chihiro.

02:52.810 --> 02:56.110
<i>You will be the one who suffers a greater pain.</i>

03:00.240 --> 03:02.700
That's why I told you not to get too involved with Chihiro.

03:02.700 --> 03:03.870
Is it painful?

03:03.870 --> 03:04.990
That's...

03:05.580 --> 03:07.200
You can still turn back now.

03:07.790 --> 03:10.620
At the moment, Chihiro doesn't know about you.

03:11.540 --> 03:14.960
If you want to disappear from her life, now is the time.

03:48.700 --> 03:51.450
Something doesn't feel right.

03:57.710 --> 03:59.210
Yes, this is Tsutsumi.

03:59.210 --> 04:02.260
Ah, Senpai. This is Shindou.

04:02.260 --> 04:03.430
Kei-chan.

04:03.430 --> 04:05.840
Can you keep me company for a bit?

04:05.840 --> 04:06.590
Eh?

04:15.690 --> 04:19.070
This is... me?

04:19.070 --> 04:21.190
Yeah, that's right.

04:22.030 --> 04:26.280
It doesn't make a difference... whether I read this or not!

04:28.240 --> 04:30.200
It's always the same day after day.

04:30.200 --> 04:34.000
I just keep repeating meaningless days.

04:34.790 --> 04:35.870
Chihiro...

04:36.420 --> 04:38.500
Do I have to keep doing it?

04:38.500 --> 04:44.670
Do I have to keep doing what's written in this diary from now on?

04:45.880 --> 04:47.930
It would be nice if I could put an end to it.

04:48.850 --> 04:51.560
It would be nice if I could put an end to such an existence.

04:55.640 --> 04:58.270
I can't calm down if I don't touch the ball.

04:59.810 --> 05:02.650
Can't you ask Hirono to keep you company?

05:02.980 --> 05:06.490
His hands are filled with work, so I can't be unreasonable.

05:07.860 --> 05:09.280
Say, Kei-chan.

05:09.280 --> 05:10.280
What is it?

05:10.620 --> 05:12.540
Are you and Hirono getting along well?

05:13.160 --> 05:15.120
G-Getting along well...

05:15.120 --> 05:19.130
Hirono-senpai and I are just like siblings.

05:19.130 --> 05:21.040
We don't really have that kind of...

05:22.840 --> 05:26.930
Nah, that's why I was asking if you two were getting along well as siblings.

05:30.180 --> 05:33.720
My mom was an actress when she was alive.

05:35.430 --> 05:38.230
My mom was really sparkling.

05:38.980 --> 05:41.310
I want to make films like those as well.

05:41.980 --> 05:43.360
Sparkling?

05:45.690 --> 05:48.610
I think you're really sparkling too.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.490
Me?

05:50.490 --> 05:51.030
Yeah.

05:51.570 --> 05:56.500
But now, you don't have that sparkle you had when we first met.

05:58.330 --> 06:00.750
I wonder if it's because something happened between Hirono and you.

06:02.630 --> 06:05.880
Somehow I feel like they're getting far away from me.

06:05.880 --> 06:09.800
By the time I noticed, they were in some faraway place I couldn't reach.

06:10.090 --> 06:10.800
Everyone...

06:10.800 --> 06:11.890
Everyone?

06:12.220 --> 06:14.180
Not just Hirono-senpai.

06:14.180 --> 06:17.100
You're also trying your best at something you want to do.

06:17.100 --> 06:19.890
My younger sister has started writing her novel.

06:20.770 --> 06:23.860
Even though she's not in a state to do something like that.

06:24.150 --> 06:27.280
Yet, I just do nothing because of this injury.

06:27.280 --> 06:29.360
I'm not sparkling at all like this.

06:30.660 --> 06:34.030
But that's not the only thing on your mind, is it?

06:36.410 --> 06:38.080
You know everything.

06:39.460 --> 06:44.630
I told you, right? If I look through the finder, I can see everything.

06:53.550 --> 06:56.430
Yahoo! Long time no see, Hirono-kun.

06:56.430 --> 06:58.470
What happened to your cell phone?

06:58.470 --> 06:59.680
I switched to this.

06:59.980 --> 07:01.980
See? A telephone card.

07:02.940 --> 07:07.360
I don't need to pay monthly charges, and I don't get weird emails and crank calls.

07:07.360 --> 07:09.070
It has lots of advantages.

07:09.070 --> 07:11.860
Then I won't be able to call you either, will I?

07:11.860 --> 07:14.410
Ah. I might've overlooked that.

07:17.870 --> 07:21.500
I'm sorry I stood you up on Sunday.

07:21.500 --> 07:23.250
Nah, it's all right.

07:23.250 --> 07:25.500
Eh? You're not mad?

07:25.500 --> 07:28.300
It's fine. Since you're here now.

07:28.550 --> 07:30.720
That's not like you.

07:30.720 --> 07:34.430
Ah, you were asked to hand in your career interest survey soon.

07:34.430 --> 07:37.680
If you keep ignoring it, they'll call your parents.

07:38.140 --> 07:40.270
What will you write?

07:40.270 --> 07:42.890
For now, I'm going to say I want to go to college.

07:43.900 --> 07:44.900
What about being a manga artist?

07:44.900 --> 07:47.900
If I write that, they'll call my parents for real.

07:47.900 --> 07:52.110
In the worst case, they'll find out about my job, and I'll be forced to quit.

07:52.110 --> 07:56.320
Your dad doesn't understand what you want to do?

07:56.620 --> 07:58.950
I was the one who got mad and left home.

08:01.330 --> 08:03.500
Isn't that nice, being free.

08:03.500 --> 08:05.710
I don't want to hear that from you.

08:06.250 --> 08:07.130
Why?

08:07.380 --> 08:11.920
You always seem to walk around all free and at ease.

08:12.170 --> 08:13.090
That's not true.

08:14.090 --> 08:17.970
My freedom is the empty kind.

08:17.970 --> 08:21.850
Yours is the freedom to choose what you want to do.

08:22.520 --> 08:27.110
A very substantial freedom that you got

08:27.110 --> 08:29.320
after experiencing a lot of hardship and pain.

08:31.320 --> 08:33.950
I don't have any freedom at all.

08:33.950 --> 08:36.570
There are lots of things I need to think about.

08:36.570 --> 08:38.070
I'm totally boxed in.

08:39.410 --> 08:42.870
If I start thinking about them, they're nothing but headaches.

08:43.330 --> 08:46.670
If they're a bother, you can just abandon them and run away.

08:48.540 --> 08:51.590
You're free to choose what you want.

08:51.590 --> 08:55.010
That's why you're also free to abandon what you want.

08:56.630 --> 08:59.760
That's right. How about running away with me?

09:00.100 --> 09:02.680
To a faraway place that nobody knows.

09:03.890 --> 09:05.520
You dummy.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.230
You're right.

09:07.560 --> 09:10.610
You're responsible for it since you made the choice.

09:10.610 --> 09:15.530
Once I'm involved with something, I can't get myself to run away and pretend it never happened.

09:15.530 --> 09:16.780
What about me?

09:17.780 --> 09:21.530
You're involved with me too, so you won't run away, right?

09:22.660 --> 09:26.660
Ah... The truth is, that's the thing I wanted to pretend it didn't happen the most.

09:26.660 --> 09:28.170
That's mean!

09:28.710 --> 09:29.670
Thank you.

09:29.670 --> 09:30.420
Eh?

09:30.880 --> 09:36.260
Because there's someone like you around, I feel like I can let out my excess stress.

09:36.590 --> 09:37.970
Hirono-kun...

09:37.970 --> 09:40.640
Well, it's just a feeling.

09:42.810 --> 09:48.100
I feel really comfortable being with you too.

09:48.100 --> 09:52.520
But only that little time I can spend with you.

09:52.770 --> 09:54.190
Miyako...

09:54.190 --> 09:56.070
Hey, Hirono-kun.

09:56.070 --> 09:57.030
Hm?

10:22.510 --> 10:24.310
Say something.

10:24.310 --> 10:26.310
S-Something...

10:26.560 --> 10:29.100
You draw shoujo manga, don't you?

10:29.100 --> 10:33.020
Don't you have any romantic lines for this kind of situation?

10:34.360 --> 10:36.900
I can't let go of you anymore.

10:37.190 --> 10:38.950
That's really corny.

10:38.950 --> 10:40.700
I-I love you.

10:40.700 --> 10:41.780
That's cliche.

10:41.780 --> 10:42.780
Je t'aime.

10:42.780 --> 10:43.910
What's that?

10:43.910 --> 10:46.410
If you're killed, I will die with you.

10:46.410 --> 10:49.000
Isn't that the wrong situation?

10:49.000 --> 10:51.670
Are you really a professional...

10:57.090 --> 10:59.550
I'm not good at ad-libbing.

10:59.550 --> 11:02.890
If I don't have my drawing paper, I can't come up with lines.

11:03.590 --> 11:07.810
Then take me to a place with drawing paper.

11:10.690 --> 11:12.850
Do you know about this story?

11:12.850 --> 11:15.520
They did an experiment before.

11:15.520 --> 11:16.730
An experiment?

11:16.730 --> 11:22.740
What kind of stuff would a baby say if it was brought up without anyone ever talking to it?

11:23.110 --> 11:25.120
There's no way it would be able to say anything.

11:25.490 --> 11:27.030
Half right.

11:27.030 --> 11:28.080
Half?

11:28.660 --> 11:33.420
Not only couldn't it say anything, but it died as well.

11:33.670 --> 11:35.250
What a sad story.

11:35.710 --> 11:40.130
In my case, I didn't die, and I can still talk properly.

11:40.130 --> 11:42.630
Miyako, you...

11:42.630 --> 11:43.510
Hirono-kun.

11:45.550 --> 11:48.680
Can you look at me alone at all times?

11:49.140 --> 11:51.680
Yeah, I will look only at you.

11:51.980 --> 11:56.610
I don't want to disappear from someone's heart again.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.660
Is it about Chihiro?

12:07.660 --> 12:08.330
Yes.

12:08.660 --> 12:10.450
That's fine. I'll listen.

12:10.830 --> 12:14.420
Chihiro has wanted to disappear for a long time.

12:14.960 --> 12:15.790
Yeah.

12:15.790 --> 12:18.420
I'm afraid of her.

12:18.670 --> 12:22.760
Don't worry. It's natural for you to feel afraid.

12:22.760 --> 12:24.590
Even if that's a mean thing to do?

12:25.760 --> 12:28.600
Do you know why she feels lonely?

12:30.220 --> 12:32.060
Yeah. Because she's all by herself.

12:32.060 --> 12:34.020
That's just the outcome.

12:34.020 --> 12:35.350
Think about the cause.

12:36.020 --> 12:38.770
Then... because she was happy.

12:38.770 --> 12:40.150
That's right.

12:40.440 --> 12:44.610
Because she learned about happiness, she feels lonely for the first time.

12:44.610 --> 12:49.080
And because she knows unhappiness, she understands happiness for the first time.

12:49.080 --> 12:50.240
No way...

12:50.620 --> 12:53.500
This world revolves around two views on the same thing.

12:53.500 --> 12:56.580
In addition, it's about laughable miseries.

12:56.580 --> 12:57.420
No way...

12:57.420 --> 13:01.670
You two walked into loneliness on your own.

13:01.670 --> 13:04.260
No way... There's no way...

13:04.260 --> 13:06.930
Are you telling me there's something else I could do?

13:08.140 --> 13:09.800
Are you satisfied with being able to let it out?

13:11.310 --> 13:13.850
Doesn't it comfort you to talk about it to someone?

13:14.810 --> 13:18.520
Why didn't you keep me away from Chihiro?

13:18.520 --> 13:19.690
I warned you.

13:19.940 --> 13:22.820
You should've prevented us from seeing each other.

13:23.400 --> 13:26.570
You're right. Maybe I wanted to watch it...

13:27.110 --> 13:31.490
A dream that someone like me might be able to succeed.

13:33.040 --> 13:37.670
I probably have the answer to what you and Chihiro should do.

13:38.540 --> 13:39.290
Do you want to know?

13:41.210 --> 13:42.460
I'll just give you a hint.

13:43.340 --> 13:46.340
Take the story that Chihiro is writing seriously.

13:46.760 --> 13:51.220
Think about the reason she's writing such a story.

13:54.310 --> 13:58.980
"The girl started drawing self-portraits the day after the wedding ceremony."

13:59.560 --> 14:04.190
"Even though she was married, there was no one except her in her world."

14:04.610 --> 14:08.200
"That's why she put herself into the paintings."

14:08.780 --> 14:12.160
"The girl put herself into all the paintings."

14:12.660 --> 14:16.450
"In that world beyond, the two of them were laughing together."

14:17.080 --> 14:21.210
"Looking at herself in the paintings, she felt strange."

14:21.210 --> 14:24.630
"The girl couldn't really understand that feeling."

14:25.090 --> 14:28.720
"Nevertheless, it continued to attract the girl's interest."

14:29.260 --> 14:31.640
"The girl is only one in the world."

14:31.640 --> 14:34.390
"That made her the god of this world."

14:38.680 --> 14:39.890
Should we take a break?

14:40.390 --> 14:43.690
I baked some cookies. I hope you like them.

14:44.110 --> 14:47.070
Thank you for everything, Renji-san.

14:47.490 --> 14:48.570
Renji-kun.

14:48.570 --> 14:50.200
Ah, I'm sorry.

14:50.200 --> 14:52.620
Unconsciously, I thought you were older than me.

14:52.620 --> 14:55.790
I see. You can just call me whatever is easier for you.

14:56.040 --> 14:58.790
Nah, please let me call you what I did before.

15:00.120 --> 15:04.840
I will go back. I will go back to my former self.

15:08.340 --> 15:12.010
I've been writing a novel, right?

15:12.010 --> 15:13.430
I'm surprised.

15:13.430 --> 15:16.350
It's almost finished.

15:16.350 --> 15:19.350
I need to keep writing it.

15:19.350 --> 15:20.850
You don't need to force yourself.

15:21.230 --> 15:22.980
We can resume when you feel like it.

15:23.520 --> 15:28.070
Will you still help me when that time comes?

15:28.070 --> 15:29.780
Yeah, of course.

15:58.890 --> 16:01.180
I've reread it three times now.

16:01.430 --> 16:06.150
Am I going back to the person you knew?

16:06.150 --> 16:09.730
Yeah. You feel just like the usual you.

16:10.360 --> 16:11.280
I'm glad to hear that.

16:11.940 --> 16:17.740
Now, I can love you the way I used to.

16:17.740 --> 16:22.160
Eh? A-Ah, I-I see.

16:22.160 --> 16:26.330
Eh? Is it possible you didn't know?

16:26.330 --> 16:31.630
Nah, it's more like... you never said you liked me to my face.

16:33.260 --> 16:35.970
But I wrote in the diary that I confessed...

16:35.970 --> 16:40.390
I was the one who confessed. Besides, it was like an accident.

16:40.390 --> 16:42.850
It wasn't a formal confession.

16:43.390 --> 16:47.730
Because I wrote that I liked you in the diary many times, I thought I already...

16:47.980 --> 16:49.730
R-Really?

16:50.860 --> 16:55.280
Did I do something rash perhaps?

16:55.280 --> 16:57.410
Nah, you think so?

16:57.910 --> 16:58.870
You could be right...

17:00.660 --> 17:03.120
Please forget what happened just now.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.830
I already heard it though.

17:05.830 --> 17:06.830
You're mean.

17:08.380 --> 17:09.710
For the past four years...

17:09.710 --> 17:10.380
Eh?

17:10.670 --> 17:14.800
For the past four years, I've just been standing still.

17:14.800 --> 17:17.840
Maybe I should say I was at a dead end.

17:18.590 --> 17:21.930
I couldn't do anything. There was nothing to do.

17:22.600 --> 17:25.680
I was just putting up with the passage of time.

17:26.140 --> 17:29.940
I wished I might as well disappear.

17:30.400 --> 17:34.440
It was really painful to read the diary of a person like that.

17:35.530 --> 17:40.660
But, the diary became really cheerful after I met you.

17:41.120 --> 17:43.580
Everyday, it was filled with happiness.

17:43.580 --> 17:47.410
I felt really lucky just from reading it.

17:48.040 --> 17:48.790
Chihiro...

17:49.080 --> 17:51.130
From here to here.

17:51.130 --> 17:54.380
These pages are my whole life to me right now.

17:54.630 --> 17:55.920
Chihiro.

17:57.090 --> 17:59.050
Thank you, Renji-kun.

18:03.970 --> 18:06.180
What are memories?

18:06.640 --> 18:07.480
What do you mean?

18:07.890 --> 18:12.480
If memories change, does personality change too?

18:13.270 --> 18:19.200
Or does personality stay the same,
but the remembered content differs?

18:19.570 --> 18:24.830
Hm... The personality might change if you talk about the exact meaning,

18:25.370 --> 18:29.370
but the person herself should stay the same for her whole life in that sense.

18:30.330 --> 18:32.040
I hope so.

18:32.420 --> 18:33.250
What's the matter?

18:33.710 --> 18:36.760
When my four years of memories disappeared,

18:36.760 --> 18:41.390
perhaps that former self was already dead.

18:42.760 --> 18:52.150
I'm also thinking that the former self that spent time with you has already disappeared.

18:52.650 --> 18:53.860
That's not true.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.730
Renji-kun.

18:55.730 --> 19:00.490
That's not true. No matter what happens, you are you.

19:01.320 --> 19:04.740
You didn't die, nor are you a different person.

19:05.410 --> 19:06.490
Renji-kun...

19:06.740 --> 19:10.410
You're the Chihiro that I've always known.

19:13.000 --> 19:14.960
You're a dummy, Chihiro.

19:14.960 --> 19:17.500
There's no way that's true.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.550
You're right.

19:22.380 --> 19:23.930
I'm weird, aren't I?

19:23.930 --> 19:25.720
Yeah, you're weird.

19:25.720 --> 19:28.640
There's no way that's true. It's impossible.

19:41.700 --> 19:44.870
There's no way... no way that's true.

19:46.780 --> 19:51.580
Why? Why are you still here?

19:52.460 --> 19:55.040
Damn it, damn it, damn it!

19:55.920 --> 20:00.010
Chihiro has forgotten about you. Chihiro doesn't remember you.

20:00.010 --> 20:02.510
Why are you still here?

20:03.680 --> 20:07.430
Are you saying Chihiro's existence is more delicate than sand?

20:07.430 --> 20:11.100
Are you saying Chihiro's memories are more fragile than sand?

20:11.100 --> 20:13.770
There's no way that's true. There's no way...

20:14.270 --> 20:15.560
Chihiro is Chihiro.

20:15.900 --> 20:19.650
She met me, she laughed with me. She's been mad, she's cried.

20:19.650 --> 20:21.280
It's the Chihiro I know!

20:22.570 --> 20:25.660
She didn't disappear! She's not a different person!

20:26.240 --> 20:29.080
Something like that... Something like that...

20:29.540 --> 20:33.370
can't be true!

20:43.380 --> 20:45.470
GIRL

20:44.050 --> 20:45.470
Hey, come here.

20:46.010 --> 20:47.680
Hurry up and come here.

20:48.010 --> 20:50.470
There's loneliness here.

20:51.850 --> 20:54.100
"The girl is only one in the world."

20:54.440 --> 20:57.400
"That made her the god of this world."

21:01.020 --> 21:03.570
I'm going to wake Onii-chan up then.

21:03.570 --> 21:05.320
How about a sandwich?

21:05.320 --> 21:06.450
Perfect.

21:06.450 --> 21:07.990
I think.

21:07.990 --> 21:09.830
That doesn't sound reliable.

21:18.250 --> 21:19.750
What's wrong, Kei-chan?

21:19.750 --> 21:22.250
Kei-chan, your leg! It's bad for you to run!

21:44.030 --> 21:50.740
kurikaesu hibi wa itsudemo

21:44.030 --> 21:50.740
The repeating days

21:51.830 --> 21:57.330
daiji na takaramono

21:51.830 --> 21:57.330
Are precious treasures at all times

21:57.460 --> 21:59.790
honto wa

21:57.460 --> 21:59.790
The truth is,

22:00.170 --> 22:06.420
tsunoru watashi no kono omoi wo

22:00.170 --> 22:06.420
I want you to find

22:07.010 --> 22:13.100
mitsukete hoshii

22:07.010 --> 22:13.100
