22:13.560 --> 22:22.940
meguru kisetsu ni kizamu keshiki

22:13.560 --> 22:22.940
Sceneries are engraved into the cycling seasons

22:22.980 --> 22:30.490
aruku michi korekara mo

22:22.980 --> 22:30.490
